&lt;li&gt;在 Get 页面支持使用三方下载器下载视频号视频(目前仅测试了aria2下载器) &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5047403431" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/477" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/477/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/477"&gt;#477&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;重复下载进行中的视频时现在会正确给出错误提示了 &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5200130094" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/517" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/517/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/517"&gt;#517&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;支持下载公众号文章中的视频 &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5200750554" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/518" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/518/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/518"&gt;#518&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MCP 服务支持更多的命令，可以获取视频号评论列表、直接创建直播下载任务等&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;在前端页面增加版本号显示，有新版本时支持在前端页面下载更新并重启服务&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;优化前端页面样式和交互，现在下载任务详情和内容详情改为在抽屉中展示，不再打开新页面了&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;移除了「原始视频」菜单项 &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5210456243" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/522" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/522/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/522"&gt;#522&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;修复了 Windows 下文件名过长或存在特殊字符时，没有正确添加后缀、有时候无法正常完成任务的问题 &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5172095119" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/505" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/505/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/505"&gt;#505&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;修复了无法访问日志页面 &lt;a href="http://127.0.0.1:2022/logs" rel="nofollow"&gt;http://127.0.0.1:2022/logs&lt;/a&gt; 的问题&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;修复了视频号详情接口缺少点赞数等字段的问题 &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5201418507" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/519" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/519/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/519"&gt;#519&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;修复了视频号评论列表接口没有返回数据的问题 &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5201418507" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/519" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/519/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/519"&gt;#519&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;修复了新版本微信(页面内嵌在聊天窗口)无法触发 onFetchFeedProfile 事件、切换视频事件的问题 &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5178090610" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/510" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/510/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/510"&gt;#510&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5202825752" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/520" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/520/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ltaoo/wx_channels_download/issues/520"&gt;#520&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content:encoded>
